 {\ixlang{更高吞吐\\不等于延迟达标}{Higher throughput\\can still miss targets}};
\ixsource{同一9270版本；各128+8、冷8192/512、零错误。12/16同机，32另一同规格节点，KV随并发调整；16/32吞吐307.15/363.58。单轮，非稳定上限。}
 {Same build 9270; 128+8, cold 8192/512, zero errors. C12/16 share a node; C32 uses an equivalent node. KV scales with concurrency. C16/32: 307.15/363.58 tok/s. One run, not a stable limit.}
